      "desc": "From hidden alleyway coffee spots to multi-level aesthetic cafes, these are some tried and tested cafes we recommend worth adding to your HCMC itinerary ☕️",
      "textExtra": []
    },
    {
      "desc": "",
      "textExtra": []
    },
    {
      "desc": "Heres the list of cafes we visited:",
      "textExtra": []
    },
    {
      "desc": "1) Kocha Matcha Spot — 2L matcha latte!",
      "textExtra": []
    },
    {
      "desc": "2) La Creme — Unique Ice Cream Flavours",
      "textExtra": []
    },
    {
      "desc": "3) Tiệm của Gỗ Ghibli — Studio Ghibli-Themed cafe",
      "textExtra": []
    },
    {
      "desc": "4) Pha Cafe — Roaster with a sunlit atrium",
      "textExtra": []
    },
    {
      "desc": "5) Ngam Cafe — Open 24hrs",
      "textExtra": []
    },
    {
      "desc": "6) Lạc Café — Old-school charm",
      "textExtra": []
    },
